A massive spider with a metallic, chrome-plated body sits at the center of an enormous web made of glowing fiber optic cables, spanning between the iconic towers of Singapore's Marina Bay skyline at dusk. The spider's legs are wrapped possessively around small trapped objects that resemble miniature websites and digital documents. The web itself pulses with neon pink and electric blue data streams. Dark storm clouds gather overhead, casting ominous shadows across the futuristic cityscape. The scene has a gritty cyberpunk aesthetic with rain-slicked surfaces reflecting the garish neon advertisements on surrounding buildings. Steam rises from street vents below while drones hover in the polluted amber sky. The spider's multiple eyes glow an unsettling red as it guards its captured digital prey.
